flowchart TB
  Request[Authenticated chat request] --> Owner[Owner and lease check]
  Owner --> Commit[Commit user message and inference run]
  Commit --> Stream[Bounded model stream]
  Stream --> Complete[Complete assistant and sources]
  Complete --> Release[Clear lease and finish run]
  Stream --> Fail[Failure or disconnect]
  Fail --> Cancel[Mark failed or cancelled / no partial assistant]
  Cancel --> Release
  Release --> History[Owned conversation history]
